<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verifikasi OTP - FinStock</title>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .auth-container {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 440px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            animation: slideUp 0.6s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .auth-container::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #25D366 0%, #128C7E 50%, #667eea 100%);
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .logo i {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #25D366;
        }

        .logo h1 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2d3748;
        }

        .welcome-text {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .welcome-text h2 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2d3748;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .welcome-text p {
            color: #718096;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .otp-input-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .otp-input {
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            letter-spacing: 12px;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.8rem;
            border: 2px solid #cbd5e0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #f7fafc;
            color: #2d3748;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .otp-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #25D366;
            background: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.2);
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #4a5568;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
        }

        .input-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .form-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.85rem 1rem 0.85rem 2.8rem;
            border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            background: #f7fafc;
        }

        .form-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #667eea;
            background: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.15);
        }

        .input-icon {
            position: absolute;
            left: 1rem;
            color: #a0aec0;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .submit-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.35);
        }

        .timer-badge {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #e53e3e;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .back-link {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 1.2rem;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
        }

        .back-link a {
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .back-link a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .alert {
            padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .alert-error {
            background-color: #fff5f5;
            color: #e53e3e;
            border: 1px solid #feb2b2;
        }

        .alert-success {
            background-color: #f0fff4;
            color: #276749;
            border: 1px solid #9ae6b4;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="auth-container">
        <div class="logo">
            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
            <h1>Verifikasi OTP</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="welcome-text">
            <h2>Masukkan Kode OTP</h2>
            <p>Kode 6 digit telah dikirimkan ke WhatsApp Anda. Kode ini berlaku selama 5 menit.</p>
        </div>

        <% if (messages && messages.error) { %>
            <div class="alert alert-error">
                <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i>
                <span><%= messages.error %></span>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <% if (messages && messages.success) { %>
            <div class="alert alert-success">
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                <span><%= messages.success %></span>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <div class="timer-badge">
            <i class="fas fa-clock"></i>
            <span>Maksimal 3 kali percobaan salah</span>
        </div>

        <form action="/verify-otp" method="POST">
            <input type="hidden" name="email" value="<%= email %>">
            <input type="hidden" name="phone" value="<%= phone %>">

            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="otp">Kode OTP (6 Digit)</label>
                <div class="otp-input-wrapper">
                    <input 
                        type="text" 
                        name="otp" 
                        id="otp" 
                        class="otp-input" 
                        placeholder="••••••" 
                        maxlength="6"
                        pattern="\d{6}"
                        required
                        autofocus
                    >
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="newPassword">Password Baru</label>
                <div class="input-wrapper">
                    <input 
                        type="password" 
                        name="newPassword" 
                        id="newPassword" 
                        class="form-input" 
                        placeholder="Minimal 6 karakter"
                        required
                    >
                    <i class="fas fa-lock input-icon"></i>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="confirmPassword">Konfirmasi Password Baru</label>
                <div class="input-wrapper">
                    <input 
                        type="password" 
                        name="confirmPassword" 
                        id="confirmPassword" 
                        class="form-input" 
                        placeholder="Ulangi password baru"
                        required
                    >
                    <i class="fas fa-check-double input-icon"></i>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">
                Simpan Password Baru
            </button>
        </form>

        <div class="back-link">
            <a href="/forgot-password"><i class="fas fa-redo"></i> Minta Kode OTP Baru</a>
            <br>
            <a href="/login" style="margin-top: 8px; display: inline-block;">Kembali ke Login</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
